		{
			dependencies: ["7BFEF80899790FC7"]
			description: [
				"Ensure that you have fully automated Precision Mechanisms. While the task seems simple on paper, you also have to consider the fact that you have to handle the salvage that results from the process of making them without having the possibility of the production line ever stopping. "
				""
				"The only exception is if you run out of the materials used to make Precision Mechanisms in the first place. However, if you have made it this far then this shouldn't be a possibility, I hope?"
			]
			hide: true
			id: "74B663ECEB73BDAD"
			subtitle: "So, are you actually ready?"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3FA32886C1B24957"
				item: "create:precision_mechanism"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Introduction to Primordial Mechanism Automation"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["74B663ECEB73BDAD"]
			description: [
				"The next few pages contain hints on how to automate this Primordial Mechanism."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Leaves can be automatically harvested through the use of Mechanical Harvesters or other methods, if applicable."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Cobblestone can be made with the use of Water touching non-source blocks of Lava."
				""
				"Automated collection is done with contraptions with Mechanical Drills with item storage attached or other methods, if applicable."
				""
				"*sigh* You should already know how Cobblestone is made and I know I don't need to tell anyone who plays Minecraft."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Coarse Dirt is made through the combination of Dirt and Gravel."
				""
				"- Dirt can be made by combining it with Bone Meal. The Bones can be acquired from Skeletons or from washing Soul Soil then crushing or milling those bones into Bone Meal."
				""
				"- Gravel is made from processing Cobblestone using a Millstone or Crushing Wheel."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Gunpowder can be automated from:"
				""
				"- Asurine which can be duplicated through the use of the Duplicator or by making Asurine with a Mechanical Extruder."
				""
				"- Creepers"
				""
				"- Combining Salt and Coal"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Coal can be automated from compressing Dried Kelp Blocks in a Basin that is heated."
				""
				"Please tell me you already have a kelp farm set up already. PLEASE."
			]
			id: "0F2E1642DE6351F0"
			subtitle: "Nature."
			tasks: [{
				id: "45C81A14275CB1F9"
				item: "kubejs:terra_mechanism"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["74B663ECEB73BDAD"]
			description: [
				"The next few pages contain hints on how to automate this Primordial Mechanism."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Create's Sweet Rolls as you know require two components:"
				""
				"- Bread"
				""
				"- Milk"
				""
				"Automating Bread production is as easy as connecting your existing wheat farms whether they are radial or linear, extracting the Wheat and then processing the Wheat through Millstones or Crushing Wheels to make more Bread than usual."
				""
				"Make Dough by bulk washing the Flour, then bulk smoke the dough to acquire Bread."
				""
				"As for Milk, have a Cow seated in a Create Seat then have a Deployer use a Bucket on the Cow to extract its Milk. Figure out how to loop the process of emptying the Bucket and then sending the Empty Bucket back to the Deployer for repeated use."
				""
				"The answer should be fairly obvious, at least I would think so."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Getting Apples in consistent amounts is going to be a bit tricky unless if you have a certain number of Oak Tree farms to overcome this inconsistency."
				""
				"The same applies to extracting Honey automatically from Beehives via Mechanical Pumps and Fluid Pipes. You will definitely need more than a few Beehives."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"For Chocolate you want to make a Cocoa Bean farm and harvest them using Mechanical Harvesters. A Rope Pulley attached to a contraption will accomplish just that."
				""
				"As for the Milk if you were paying attention to page 2, you would already know how to handle that problem."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The leaves for Builder's Tea can also be farmed from your tree farms. Just add Mechanical Harvesters to get the leaf blocks."
			]
			id: "3D52A8726183B5E7"
			subtitle: "Food."
			tasks: [{
				id: "62FEBC77604D6A11"
				item: "kubejs:gluttony_mechanism"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 1.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["74B663ECEB73BDAD"]
			description: [
				"The next few pages contain hints on how to automate this Primordial Mechanism."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"You already know how to get iron if you've made it this far. I don't need to elaborate further."
				""
				"The alternative is utilizing Crimsite."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Andesite can be easily automated from making Diorite and Cobblestone. Combine the output from your iron farms."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Copper from Veridium."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Zinc from Asurine."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Brass from combining Copper and Z- wait shouldn't you know this already?"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Gold from washing Red Sand. Washing Soul Sand has a lower yield for Gold Nuggets."
				""
				"The alternative is utilizing Ochrum."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Bottomless pit of Molten Netherite is the easiest solution."
				""
				"The intended way was from combining Netherrack and Shimmer."
			]
