		{
			dependencies: ["74B663ECEB73BDAD"]
			description: [
				"The next few pages contain hints on how to automate this Primordial Mechanism."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The mixing recipe for making Amethyst with Iron Nuggets in a superheated Basin was the intended way, but since Ars Nouveau exists you can get your Amethyst that way as well."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Quartz is one of the byproducts of bulk washing Soul Sand."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Diamonds are the result of compressing Coal Blocks with some lava inside a superheated Basin."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Quartz, glass and some iron nuggets in a superheated Basin was the intended method of making Emeralds."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Rose Quartz is easy, simply combine the redstone byproduct of washing Crushed Raw Iron which you can get from crushing Crimsite."
				""
				"Combine with your Soul Sand factory that's already washing Soul Sand for Quartz."
				""
				"Easy, right?"
			]
